checkin-reminder = Please use /checkin to confirm that you can manage your data yourself. A confirmation cancels pending release requests.
inactivity-detected = You have not confirmed activity within the configured period. Your trusted contacts have been asked to review whether you can manage your data yourself. Use /checkin or /stop to cancel transmission.
guardian-request = The owner has not confirmed activity within the configured period. Confirm only if, based on what you know, the owner is unable to manage their data themselves and you agree to release this secret. A missed confirmation alone does not establish this. Tap Submit code, then reply to the request with your saved code.
submit-code = Submit code
code-prompt = Reply to this message with your saved guardian code only if, based on what you know, the owner is unable to manage their data themselves and you agree to release this secret. The code confirms this request only.
code-accepted = Code accepted for this release request.
quorum-reached = The required guardians confirmed the release request. The waiting period has started. You can still cancel using /checkin or /stop.
case-expired = Guardian collection expired. A new request can be created after the cooldown.
cancel-vote-request = A guardian requested cancellation. Open /guardians to review and vote. Cancellation requires everyone's explicit vote.
vote-cancel = Vote to cancel
request-cancel = Request cancellation
done = Done
back = ← Back
text = Text
